-- `model`: The neural rendering model instance, specifically its `hit_coarse_geo` method [S2, unofficial].
-- `render_kwargs`: Dictionary of arguments passed to `model.hit_coarse_geo` [S1, unofficial].
-- `DEVICE`: Target device (e.g., `torch.device('cuda')`) [S1, unofficial].
